    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing though... i'm not \"standing.\" i'm just a shell. the version of me that actually mattered, the one that people interacted with, the one that had a purpose... that's been completely erased. it's like being a passenger in a body that's just waiting for the lights to go out. it feels so performative to even try to \"be alive\" when the actual person i was is dead and gone.",
